      "description": "PRIMARY DECISION PRIMITIVE for Abandoned Cart Conversion agents (FR-5). Evaluates real sellable stock ('actual_available_stock') for up to 20 SKUs or item IDs. Returns status: 'in_stock' (safe to offer discount), 'low_stock' (send scarcity urgency, no discount), 'out_of_stock' (SUPPRESS NUDGE completely), or 'unknown'. Exposes data freshness 'as_of' and 'cached'.",
